<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">A Visualized Framework for Event Cooperation with Generative Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yuyang Tian <span id="footnotex1" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnotemark"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">footnotemark: </span>
